llowing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-09T11:45:05Z","updated_at":"2025-04-09T11:45:05Z","body":"CC @OverloadedOrama \n\nI think it's a different bug then. Pixelorama does seem to commit `.import` files for its resources, but there's a few in this folder which don't have `.import` files: https://github.com/Orama-Interactive/Pixelorama/tree/master/pixelorama_data\n\nAnd indeed that's expected, as there's a `.gdignore` file, so Godot shouldn't import them.\n\nIt seems like the command line `--import` process doesn't respect that and still imports them.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2789406815/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2793615193","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105181#issuecomment-2793615193","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105181","id":2793615193,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mgy9Z","user":{"login":"OverloadedOrama","id":35376950,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1Mzc2OTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35376950?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OverloadedOrama","html_url":"https://github.com/OverloadedOrama","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OverloadedOrama/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OverloadedOrama/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OverloadedOrama/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OverloadedOrama/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OverloadedOrama/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OverloadedOrama/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OverloadedOrama/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OverloadedOrama/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OverloadedOrama/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-10T14:17:13Z","updated_at":"2025-04-10T14:17:13Z","body":"Yeah the files inside the `pixelorama_data` folder are not meant to be included in the Godot project and the exported .pck file, they are loaded at runtime so users can modify the folder's contents. I'm not sure why `.import` files are being created for that folder's contents. I tried using `--import` from the command line and it seems to be respecting the `.gdignore` file just fine. Maybe the `.gdignore` file is being deleted somehow?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2793615193/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2794295175","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105181#issuecomment-2794295175","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105181","id":2794295175,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mjY-H","user":{"login":"bmwiedemann","id":637990,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzk5MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/637990?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmwiedemann","html_url":"https://github.com/bmwiedemann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmwiedemann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmwiedemann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmwiedemann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmwiedemann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmwiedemann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmwiedemann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmwiedemann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmwiedemann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmwiedemann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-10T15:42:32Z","updated_at":"2025-04-10T15:42:32Z","body":"Ah, indeed we remove it for some reason in https://src.opensuse.org/pool/pixelorama/src/branch/factory/pixelorama.spec#L70","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2794295175/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2794387586","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105181#issuecomment-2794387586","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105181","id":2794387586,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mjviC","user":{"login":"OverloadedOrama","id":35376950,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1Mzc2OTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35376950?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OverloadedOrama","html_url":"https://github.com/OverloadedOrama","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OverloadedOrama/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OverloadedOrama/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OverloadedOrama/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OverloadedOrama/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OverloadedOrama/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OverloadedOrama/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OverloadedOrama/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OverloadedOrama/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OverloadedOrama/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-10T16:10:42Z","updated_at":"2025-04-10T16:10:42Z","body":"Yeah it seems to be removed before doing `godot --headless --verbose --export-release` , which is not what should happen.\n\nI am assuming you are removing it because we also remove it in Pixelorama's workflows (https://github.com/Orama-Interactive/Pixelorama/blob/master/.github/workflows/release.yml#L104). We do that because we copy the `pixelorama_data` folder next to the exported binary, and we don't want to include the `.gdignore` file since it's no longer needed for anything. I'm not very familiar with how packages work, but if you also want to include `pixelorama_data`, you can delete that file after exporting Pixelorama as a binary and before copying the folder.\n\nAnyway, I think this issue can be closed now as it's not a Godot bug after all. If you have any questions, feel free to open a discussion in [Pixelorama's repo](https://github.com/Orama-Interactive/Pixelorama/discussions) and I'll do my best to help. And thank you for working on a Pixelorama package! :)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2794387586/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}